110809","synopsis":"As they journey to the Country of Long Nights, Ellie begins to notice subtle changes in Insomniac, whom she has known since childhood, that leave her uneasy. They arrive in a land where blue flowers bloom, and preparations are underway for the annual Walpurga Eve festival. But beneath its peaceful surface, Insomniac senses an ominous presence, and the country's hidden secrets slowly come to light.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12017047/screencap/6ad73a9c36102.jpg"}]}]}
